--
-- Two business-prefixed modules, one row per source subcategory:
--
--   biz_client_individual (117)  <- every personal subcategory   (90 rows incl. catch-all)
--   biz_client_company    (118)  <- every business subcategory   (110 rows incl. catch-all)
--
-- documentKey = "<sourceModule>-<sourceDocument>", e.g. identity-pan_card.
-- See src/lib/clientCategories.ts for why, and for the rules (never rename).
-- Generated from CLIENT_CATEGORY_SEED; tests/clientCategories.test.ts diffs the
-- two. Subcategories a super admin adds LATER are derived at runtime by
-- syncClientCategories() (scripts/sync_client_categories.ts, run by
-- `npm run migrate`). Field specs resolve from the source pair, so no
-- document_category_fields rows are written here.
